{
  "key": 22327,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "You have to warm up before going into\n",
        "the water.\r",
        "That’s basic.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00001",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00002",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, you’re young and fit!\n",
        "Don’t ride your Pokémon! Swim!\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00004",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00005",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you going to Cianwood?\r",
        "How about a quick battle first?\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00007",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00008",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "No inflatable tube for me.\n",
        "I’m hanging on to a sea Pokémon!\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00010",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00011",
      "garbage": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "You can’t see it from here, but there\n",
        "is a big city called Cianwood\f",
        "across the sea."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "I took the ship to go to Olivine for\n",
        "some sightseeing. I really liked\f",
        "the atmosphere.\r",
        "Being a port, it was nothing like\n",
        "the big cities."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know what lies just past\n",
        "this gate?\r",
        "It’s the Battle Frontier!\r",
        "Every time I have a journey, I’ve\n",
        "raised mostly “useful” Pokémon.\r",
        "But now that I am here, I think I\n",
        "should have brought my\f",
        "“battle” Pokémon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey!\n",
        "Great waves here!\r",
        "No one can resist such\n",
        "good waves!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "I see... You don’t have Surf yet...\n",
        "This is just between you and me...\r",
        "I got Surf from a man at Ecruteak,\n",
        "and I think he’s still there.\r",
        "Why don’t you try going there?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "This is just between you and me.\n",
        "I got Surf from a man at Ecruteak.\f",
        "I think he’s still there.\r",
        "Why don’t you try going there?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey!\n",
        "Great waves here!\r",
        "No one can resist such\n",
        "good waves!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 40\n",
        "South to Cianwood City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00020",
      "en_US": "Battle Frontier Ahead"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Izumi: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It has been a long time.\r",
        "In fact, I was looking for you.\n",
        "I’ve got an Egg here that was\f",
        "washed up on the shore,\f",
        "but it’s a little special compared\f",
        "to other Eggs you may have seen.\r",
        "Would you be willing to take it? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "Izumi: I see.\n",
        "Come back if you change your mind."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00023",
      "en_US": "Izumi: Thank you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00024",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received the {COLOR 2}Manaphy Egg{COLOR 0}!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00025",
      "en_US": [
        "Izumi: You should be able to take\n",
        "care of it the same as any other\f",
        "Egg. I shall take my leave..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Izumi: Although I do want to give\n",
        "this Egg to you...\r",
        "...Your party is full."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00027",
      "en_US": [
        "Izumi: Hello, again.\n",
        "Do you wish to accept the Egg? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "They say schools of Phione\n",
        "sometimes cross the warm sea here.\r",
        "You might encounter one if you’re\n",
        "really lucky!\r",
        "I’d like to see one...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "That Pokémon you have behind you!\n",
        "Sigh, that’s not a Phione..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00030",
      "en_US": "That Pokémon you have behind you!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a Phione!\n",
        "Wow, you must be lucky!\r",
        "Thank you for showing me.\n",
        "Please, take these as thanks!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0744_W40_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "Nobody really knows if Phione\n",
        "counts as legendary or not.\r",
        "Either way, it’s still so cute!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
